wrestled Kipland to the ground before he was arrested. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.katu.com/news/local/8082147.html; http://www.pbs.org/wgbh/pages/frontline/shows/kinkel/kip/cron.html; http://....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>1998-05-21</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-123.02203,44.04624,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Columbine High School massacre - Littleton, Colorado</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/20/1999. Venue type: school. Killed: 13. Injured: 24. Total victims: 37. Eric Harris, 18, and Dylan Klebold, 17, opened fire throughout Columbine High School before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.usatoday.com/news/nation/2009-04-13-columbine-myths_N.htm; http://www.vpc.org/studies/wgun990420.htm; http://....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>1999-04-20</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-105.0741,39.60403,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Atlanta day trading spree killings - Atlanta, Georgia</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/29/1999. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 9. Injured: 13. Total victims: 22. Day trader Mark O. Barton, 44, who had recently lost a substantial sum of money, went on a shooting spree through two day-trading firms. He started at the All-Tech Investment Group, where he worked, then went on to Momentum Securities. He fled and hours later, after being cornered by police outside a gas station, committed suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.independent.co.uk/news/i-dont-plan-to-live-much-longer-just-long-enough-to-kill-the-people-that-greedily-soug....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>1999-07-29</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-84.37784,33.85012,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Wedgwood Baptist Church shooting - Fort Worth, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/15/1999. Venue type: religious. Killed: 8. Injured: 7. Total victims: 15. Larry Gene Ashbrook, 47, opened fire inside the Wedgwood Baptist Church during a prayer rally before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/1999/09/20/us/fort-worth-remembers-those-killed-at-church.html?pagewanted=all&amp;src=pm; http://www.....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>1999-09-15</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-97.38425,32.66451,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Xerox killings - Honolulu, Hawaii</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/2/1999. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 7. Injured: 0. Total victims: 7. Byran Koji Uyesugi, 40, a Xerox service technician, opened fire inside the building with a 9mm Glock. He fled and was later apprehended by police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://archives.starbulletin.com/2000/06/02/news/story2.html; http://www.vpc.org/studies/wgun991102.htm.</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>1999-11-02</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-157.87646,21.32006,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hotel shooting - Tampa, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>12/30/1999. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 3. Total victims: 8. Hotel employee Silvio Leyva, 36, gunned down four coworkers at the Radisson Bay Harbor Inn before killing a woman outside who refused to give him her car. He was arrested shortly after the shootings. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.sptimes.com/News/123000/news_pf/TampaBay/A_year_later__the_str.shtml; http://www.vpc.org/studies/wgun991230.h....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>1999-12-30</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-82.57059,27.96648,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Wakefield massacre - Wakefield, Massachusetts</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>12/26/2000. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 7. Injured: 0. Total victims: 7. Michael McDermott, 42, opened fire on co-workers at Edgewater Technology and was later arrested. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.time.com/time/magazine/article/0,9171,93313,00.html; http://articles.cnn.com/2002-04-22/justice/ctv.mcdermott....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2000-12-26</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-71.07591,42.50043,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Navistar shooting - Melrose Park, Illinois</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/5/2001. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 4. Total victims: 9. Fired employee William D. Baker, 66, opened fire at his former Navistar workplace before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://articles.chicagotribune.com/2001-02-07/news/0102070122_1_navistar-gun-law-hunting-rifle; http://www.vpc.org/studi....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in re