he NFL, Blackstone and other corporations. He shot himself fatally after killing four people, including a police officer, and wounding another. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/29/nyregion/nyc-shooting-midtown-gunman-victims.html; https://www.washingtonpost.com/nat.... Coordinates city-level (geocoded from the dataset place name).</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2025-07-28</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-73.98553,40.75796,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Reno casino shooting - Reno, Nevada</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/28/2025. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 3. Total victims: 6. Dakota Hawver, 26, opened fire in a parking area of the Grand Sierra Resort, soon exchaning gunfire with responding police, who wounded and apprehended him. He had no known criminal or mental health history, according to local authorities. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/multiple-people-injured-reno-hotel-casino-shooting-rcna221532; https://www.nbcnews..... Coordinates city-level (geocoded from the dataset place name).</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2025-07-28</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-119.81266,39.52618,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Montana bar shooting - Anaconda, Montana</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>8/1/2025. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 4. Injured: 0. Total victims: 4. Michael Paul Brown, 45, the suspect in the attack, is an Army veteran who served in Iraq. Brown struggled with mental illness for years, according to family members who spoke to news media after the attack. Brown fled the scene and was captured after an eight-day manhunt. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.wsj.com/us-news/manhunt-for-montana-bar-gunman-enters-third-day-1d7f5d8f; https://www.nytimes.com/2025/08/08.... Coordinates city-level (geocoded from the dataset place name).</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2025-08-01</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-112.95313,46.12947,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Austin parking lot shooting - Austin, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>8/11/2025. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Ethan Nieneker, 32, allegedly fled after opening fire in a Target parking lot in Austin, and was soon apprehended elsewhere in Austin by police. He allegedly had a criminal record including domestic violence and a history of mental health problems, according to local authorities. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.cnn.com/2025/08/11/us/shooting-austin-target-four-injured; https://abcnews.go.com/US/shooting-reported-targe.... Coordinates city-level (geocoded from the dataset place name).</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2025-08-11</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-97.7437,30.27113,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>North Carolina waterfront bar shooting - Southport Yacht Basin, North Carolina</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/27/2025. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 8. Total victims: 11. Nigel Edge (formerly Sean DeBevoise), 39, an ex-Marine and decorated Iraq war veteran, opened fire from a boat at the waterfront establishment; was arrested the following day by